        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME. Proposed interactions and technical DTO limits, not an existing deployed endpoint, provider acceptance or approved missing business policy. Every mutation rechecks current session/role/CSRF; user-supplied actor/state is ignored. External delivery/transfer is outside database transactions. Cash/VietQR verification, voluntary tip allocation, zero-due treatment and receipt registry require approved adapters/policies. No real collection, message delivery or hand-back is asserted." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
